{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31388","headline":"题圭峰下长孙家林亭 · 韩琮","name":"题圭峰下长孙家林亭","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"赵国林亭二百年，绿苔如毯葛如烟。\n闲期竹色摇霜看，醉惜松声枕月眠。\n出树圭峰寒压坐，入篱沙濑碧流天。\n明知富贵非身物，莫爲金章堕地仙。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩琮","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_31388.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31388","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}